    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>If you plant an ordinary shrub in this 10-pound clay pot and let it grow for 30 days, the shrub magically becomes an @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmAwakenedShrub0]{Awakened Shrub} at the end of that time. As it awakens, its roots break the pot, destroying it.</p><p>The awakened shrub is Friendly toward you and obeys your commands. Without commands from you, it does nothing.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-nABVvVV9e7TC6sBv\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Au bout des 30 jours, l’activité <em>Awaken Shrub</em> place l’arbuste éveillé et détruit le pot.</p></section>",
